          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html> \n<html> \n<head>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"aboutme.css\">\n</head>\n <body>\n   <!-- info about me -->\n   <h1> All About Me! </h1> \n \n   <!-- 1) Add an image to the page -->\n   <h3>Cool Picture</h3> \n   \n   \n  </body> \n</html>",
